2026-10-17 09:06:48,106 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=The best way to help slow down a vehicle and reduce the need to use brakes is to use a device called a "speed limiter". A speed limiter is a device that can be installed on a vehicle's transmission system in order to limit the maximum speed of the vehicle. The installation of a speed limiter on a vehicle's transmission system is typically done by a professional mechanic or technician who has experience installing and maintaining transmission systems for vehicles.
