2026-10-17 11:45:11,411 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=Out of commission means the vehicle is not able to be driven safely. 
Broken or missing leaf springs can cause problems with the suspension system, which can lead to instability while driving, and even the possibility of a rollover accident.
