2026-10-17 15:13:35,859 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=The tires that cannot be recapped, retreaded, or regrooved on a bus are those that have been used for an extended period of time. This means that the tires have been subjected to wear and tear over an extended period of time. As a result, the tires may not be able to be recapped, retreaded, or regrooved on a bus.
