2026-10-17 15:24:03,001 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=To supply air to the trailer brake system, you should:

1. Check that the trailer brake system is properly connected to the air supply.
2. Ensure that the air supply is properly maintained and not contaminated with any hazardous substances.
3. Always operate the air supply in a safe and responsible manner, following all relevant safety guidelines and regulations.
