2026-10-17 15:32:59,446 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=Before coupling two units, it is important to secure both units properly. This can be done by securing each unit's wheels properly with chocks or other means. Additionally, it may be necessary to secure each unit's spring brakes properly as well. By taking these steps to properly secure each unit before attempting to couple them, the risk of any potential issues or accidents occurring during the coupling process can be significantly reduced.
