2026-10-18 11:09:43,404 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=If engine oil pressure drops dangerously low, a driver should immediately shut down the engine and wait for sufficient air pressure to turn off the low-pressure warning signal. If the engine is not shut down in time, it could cause serious damage to the engine and other components of the vehicle. Therefore, it is extremely important for drivers to always be aware of the engine oil pressure gauge and to take immediate action if the gauge shows a dangerously low reading.
