2026-10-18 11:10:05,963 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=If engine oil pressure drops dangerously low, the driver should immediately shut down the engine and wait for sufficient air pressure to activate the low-pressure warning signal. If the driver does not shut down the engine in time, it could cause serious damage to the engine and other components of the vehicle. Therefore, it is essential for drivers to be aware of the importance of maintaining proper oil pressure levels in their vehicles.
