2026-10-18 12:30:02,501 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=The purpose of hazardous--material placards is to provide warning and instructions to drivers and other individuals who may come into contact with hazardous materials. Placards are typically used in situations where there is a risk of exposure to hazardous materials, such as when transporting cargo that contains hazardous materials.
