2026-10-18 14:29:37,629 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=The trailer that should generally be positioned first when pulling doubles with different weights is the one with the lower weight. This is because positioning the heavier trailer first will cause the lighter trailer to move forward and potentially hit the heavier trailer. On the other hand, positioning the lighter trailer first will allow the heavier trailer to move forward and potentially hit the lighter trailer.
