2026-10-18 14:46:24,611 INFO backend.app: llm final response topic=CDLA text=The number of button presses required to initiate or terminate a permitted hands-free call depends on the specific device and its user interface.
In general, hands-free devices are designed to allow users to operate their vehicles while keeping their hands free.
