ol bus.\n\n[5] Question: Why should children never walk behind a school bus?\nExcerpt: The driver may not see them.\n</sources>\nQuestion: What should a child do before crossing in front of a school bus?"}], "stream": true, "options": {"temperature": 0.2, "num_ctx": 16384, "num_predict": 2048}}
