\nschool bus to communicate presence and intentions to \nstop/resume student loading and unloading with other \ntraffic.\n\n[4] Question: While driving a manual truck, you should use your ? to help figure out the best times to upshift.\nExcerpt: Tachometer! Your tachometer will show you the motor's rpms. When you reach the top of the range, you know it's time to shift.\n\n[5] Question: While driving a manual truck, you should use your ? to help figure out the best times to upshift.\nExcerpt: tachometer\n</sources>\nQuestion: What does an S-cam do?"}], "stream": true, "options": {"temperature": 0.2, "num_ctx": 16384, "num_predict": 2048}}
